## CI policy (DND-2.3+)

```text
feature → develop
= local Sprint Final Quality Gate only (no GitHub CI required)

develop → master
= full GitHub CI promotion gate (required)
```

Do not pull into active work unless the sprint explicitly requires it:

- Phase 3 Auto-Layout work outside the active DND-3.x sprint
- AI-assisted layout intelligence (Phase 4, after Auto-Layout)
- Flutter implementation (post-Alpha / Core-contract dependent; not blocked by AI)
- Vue / Angular / Svelte adapters (post-alpha, demand-driven)

Do not turn roadmap ideas into committed calendar dates in docs or code comments unless explicitly asked.

